Now add a process exit cleanup to avoid orphans:

```js
process.on("exit", () => {
  for (const pid of started) { spawnSync("taskkill", ["/PID", String(pid), "/T", "/F"], {stdio:"ignore"}) }
})
```
Careful: this runs on normal exit too (after the finally has already killed children — taskkill on dead pids is harmless).

